      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 5872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’re really something, showing off as much\nagility as a speedy Pokémon like Froakie!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI hope you’ll make it to the top of every last one of\nour scaffolding courses with your new pal!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
