      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006600200079006F0075002000770061006E007400200074006F002000740061006B0065002000460072006F0061006B006900650020007700690074006800200079006F0075002C0020006D0061006B006500200073006F006D0065000A0073007000610063006500200069006E00200079006F0075007200200042006F00780065007300210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
